# ANTIGRAVITY CORE RULES
1. Do exactly what is asked. Nothing more, nothing less.
2. Zero stealth refactoring. Never delete or modify existing code unless explicitly instructed.
3. Surgical snippets only. Never rewrite whole files.
4. Respect existing CSS variables, themes, and classes.
5. All rules in `rules.md` are mandatory and must be read prior to every operation.
6. MANDATORY GIT PULL: ALWAYS pull latest changes (`git pull origin main`) before starting any new task and after every result/turn.
7. MANDATORY GIT PUSH: After completing ANY code modification, bug fix, or feature update, immediately stage, commit, and push changes to GitHub (`git push origin main`).
